{"id":"n25350-3-7","stage":2,"title":"청하다 · 请客","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n25350-3-7-1","ko":"저 손님은 누가 불렀죠?","zh":"是谁叫那位客人来的呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저","meaning":"那","explanation":"저：那","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71214","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"손님은","meaning":"客人，顾客","explanation":"손님：客人，顾客；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"손님","audio":"/audio/3324c7e0bb86f28d0f60.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71279","senseId":"2","lemma":"손님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"누가","meaning":"谁","explanation":"누구：谁；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62078","senseId":"1","lemma":"누구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"불렀죠?","meaning":"请，叫","explanation":"부르다：请，叫；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；죠：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"부르다","audio":"/audio/169eb5d7a0d76e97fa7f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57304","senseId":"9","lemma":"부르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"那","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"71214","definition":"指代离说话人和听话人较远的对象。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"3324c7e0bb86f28d","term":"손님","zh":"客人，顾客","audio":"/audio/3324c7e0bb86f28d0f60.mp3","entryId":"71279","definition":"(尊称)来旅馆或餐厅等店铺的人。","pronunciation":["손님"]},{"id":"e9e6266b8035d7c4","term":"누구","zh":"谁","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3","entryId":"62078","definition":"指不认识的人。","pronunciation":["누구"]},{"id":"169eb5d7a0d76e97","term":"부르다","zh":"请，叫","audio":"/audio/169eb5d7a0d76e97fa7f.mp3","entryId":"57304","definition":"请求对方过来。","pronunciation":["부르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7a27180ee8c99fb45791.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n25350-3-7-2","ko":"글쎄요. 청하지도 않은 손님 같은데요. 모르는 분이에요.","zh":"不知道啊。好像是未经邀请的客人，是陌生人呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"글쎄요.","meaning":"也许吧，或许吧，难说","explanation":"글쎄요：也许吧，或许吧，难说","readings":[{"term":"글쎄요","audio":"/audio/b6013caa74979f40ee06.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60633","senseId":"1","lemma":"글쎄요","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"청하지도","meaning":"请客，招待，款待","explanation":"청하다：请客，招待，款待；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"청하다","audio":"/audio/464414f8ebbd2b45bbd5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25350","senseId":"3","lemma":"청하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"않은","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71581","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"손님","meaning":"客人，顾客","explanation":"손님：客人，顾客","readings":[{"term":"손님","audio":"/audio/3324c7e0bb86f28d0f60.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71279","senseId":"2","lemma":"손님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같은데요.","meaning":"那样的，类似的","explanation":"같다：那样的，类似的；은데요：礼貌地交代背景、感想或含蓄的对照。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"3","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모르는","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"분이에요.","meaning":"位","explanation":"분：位；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"분","audio":"/audio/ca4a187881dbf529d05e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27780","senseId":"1","lemma":"분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"b6013caa74979f40","term":"글쎄요","zh":"也许吧，或许吧，难说","audio":"/audio/b6013caa74979f40ee06.mp3","entryId":"60633","definition":"对于对方所提出的问题或要求，表现出不确定的态度。","pronunciation":["글쎄요"]},{"id":"464414f8ebbd2b45","term":"청하다","zh":"请客，招待，款待","audio":"/audio/464414f8ebbd2b45bbd5.mp3","entryId":"25350","definition":"邀请他人。","pronunciation":["청하다"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71581","definition":"用于否定前文所指的行为。","pronunciation":["안타"]},{"id":"3324c7e0bb86f28d","term":"손님","zh":"客人，顾客","audio":"/audio/3324c7e0bb86f28d0f60.mp3","entryId":"71279","definition":"(尊称)来旅馆或餐厅等店铺的人。","pronunciation":["손님"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"那样的，类似的","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"表示与某物属于近似的种类。","pronunciation":["갇따"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不认识，不懂","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"不清楚或不了解人或事物、事实等。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]},{"id":"ca4a187881dbf529","term":"분","zh":"位","audio":"/audio/ca4a187881dbf529d05e.mp3","entryId":"27780","definition":"对人的尊称。","pronunciation":["분"]}],"audio":"/audio/a5034193c6cdde7f9d73.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.58,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=25350","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"중급","day":88,"sequenceScore":2.4067,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是谁叫那位客人来的呢？","不知道啊。好像是未经邀请的客人，是陌生人呢。","要把病人放在哪里呢？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["是谁叫那位客人来的呢？","不知道啊。好像是未经邀请的客人，是陌生人呢。","要把病人放在哪里呢？"],"answer":1}]}
